  {
    "id": "chunk-2",
    "section": "RETURN POLICY",
    "content": "Customers may return items within 30 days of the purchase date.\nAll returned items must be unused and in their original packaging with all accessories included.\nElectronics such as laptops, phones, and tablets must be returned within 15 days.\nItems marked as \"Final Sale\" cannot be returned or exchanged.\nTo initiate a return, contact support@techmart.com with your order number.",
    "sourceDoc": "TechMart_Company_Policy.docx",
