    "id": "chunk-3",
    "section": "REFUND POLICY",
    "content": "Refunds are processed within 5 business days after the returned item is received.\nRefunds are issued to the original payment method only.\nShipping costs are non-refundable unless the return is due to a defective or wrong item.\nIf you paid by credit card, it may take an additional 3–5 business days for the refund to appear.",
